IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-ENGINE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 BUDGET-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NUM-PAGES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HARD-PINNED-PAGES   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 BUDGET-USED         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-ENGINE.
    IF BUDGET-TOKENS == 0 OR NUM-PAGES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF NUM-PAGES > 4
        MOVE 4 TO HARD-PINNED-PAGES.
    ELSE
        MOVE NUM-PAGES TO HARD-PINNED-PAGES.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-PAGES TO R14.
    MULTIPLY 32 BY R14.
    IF R14 < BUDGET-TOKENS
        MOVE R14 TO BUDGET-USED.
    ELSE
        MOVE BUDGET-TOKENS TO BUDGET-USED.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 BUDGET-USED.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
